<opml version="2.0"><head><title>Production-Grade ML System (7-Layer Architecture)</title></head><body><outline text="Production-Grade ML System"><outline text="Layer 1 – Data Ingestion &amp; Validation" /><outline text="Layer 2 – Feature Engineering &amp; Preprocessing" /><outline text="Layer 3 – Model Training" /><outline text="Layer 4 – Experiment Tracking &amp; Governance" /><outline text="Layer 5 – Model Evaluation &amp; Quality Gates" /><outline text="Layer 6 – Deployment &amp; Serving" /><outline text="Layer 7 – Ops: Monitoring, Feedback &amp; Retraining" /></outline></body></opml>